## 🔄 Backup & Recovery

### Automated Backups
- Daily Firestore backup enabled
- Weekly full database snapshot
- Retention: 30 days

### Manual Backup Command
```bash
firebase firestore:export gs://flokower-backup/backups/$(date +%Y%m%d)
```

### Restore Command
```bash
firebase firestore:import gs://flokower-backup/backups/backup_file.json
```

---

## ⚙️ CI/CD Pipeline (Planned)

**GitHub Actions Workflow:**
1. On push to `main`:
   - Run `flutter analyze`
   - Execute unit tests
   - Deploy to Firebase Hosting (staging)

2. On tag creation:
   - Run integration tests
   - Build release APK/IPA
   - Deploy to TestFlight/Play Console Internal Track

